<table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 17, 2003 :: Grats Zavitar and Voragon!</div><P>Two more epics that I have no pictures for (but really, Voragon doesn't want me to take a picture with old models and no effects... who wants to see a blockhead dwarf with a wrench?)! A group of us ran Voragon to get some final peices while Wonderous led Zavitar, Jen, Cerd, Wellish and Sparkley to clear Fear for us. Once they'd cleared a nice chunk, Team Slacker zoned in and helped finish the job. Reide played crazy cowboy and rounded up Amy Temply and Shissar and soon Zavitar got some much needed head! Voragon did his turn in to Irak whatever and got his epic, and Grik got a step closer to his. </P>
<P>Thanks late night crew for coming out and getting a few mobs killed!</P>
<P>Oh yah... and some of us ran over and did the 8th Shawl War for Tempys! Grats to the Greed Roll winners of the loot! </P>
<P>Levels.. I know some more folks made levels. But Wonderbutt wasn't around to keep up with it all! I remember Khyrra making 40! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 16, 2003 :: Feet... more feet!</div><P>More killing of Inny to get some more upgrades and kill the ugly blue bastard! Grat to Lushissx on a shiny new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/dreadscale_cloak.jpg">Dreadscale Cloak </A>and Beryllin and Lairiel both walked away with <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/polished_zraxthril_coif.jpg">Polished Zraxthril Coif</A>! Now for the feet shot!</P>
<P><IMG alt="need Mysch if you don't want feet pics!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/inny4.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>&nbsp;</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 16, 2003 :: Leveling Updates!</div><P>We've had quite a few guildmates level in the past few days!</P>
<P>Congratulation to the following folks!</P>
<UL>
<LI>Thayet on 61st!
<LI>Aridius on 63rd! 
<LI>Morlith 47th! 
<LI>Lumalie on 58th! 
<LI>Ewlala on 53rd! 
<LI>Tearem on 54th! 
<LI>Cimerene on 60th and Crusader! 
<LI>Tryder on 60 and Phantasmist! 
<LI>Zorin on 56th! 
<LI>Zentox on 54th! 
<LI>Mytee on 50th! 
<LI>Shatta on 49th! 
<LI>Sparkley on 59th! 
<LI>Tylokki on 61st! 
<LI>Arwiin on 48!</LI></UL>
<P>&nbsp;Congrulations to everyone! Keep up the awesome work!.</P>
<P>- Wonderous</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Wonderous<br> :: Last edited by Wonderous on Oct 17, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 14, 2003 :: And.. now for something completely different...</div><P>More hedge flagging done. Ran it a bit later to get a few more members who missed out before! Grats Cerdiwan on your Black Bastardsword, Vixxyn on a Twisted Longbow and Sparkley on the greed roll for a Twisted Longbow!</P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/con1.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 12, 2003 :: Couple of Epics today!</div><P>After many many many hours in Hate, three elusive drops finally appeared! Grats Zavitar and Lumalie on essence, and Thayet on the staff! Zavitar just lacks one drop for his snakedom... but now onto the epic grats!</P>
<P>Lumalie looking sexy with some bite!<BR><IMG alt="Rezz effects maybe gone too!" hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/lumalie_epic_02.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Sexy little gnomer showing off her colors!<BR><IMG alt="Yet another pet, and this time not a necro!" hspace=0 src="http://oregonstate.edu/~powern/images/thayet_epic_01.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Some belated and incomplete leveling grats...</P>
<P>Grats Erowyn on 65 and Arch Convoker!<BR>Grats Wonderous on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Jenreree on 63!<BR>Grats Aridius on 62!<BR>Grats Thayet on 60 and Arch Mage!<BR>Grats Softeyes on 59!<BR>Grats Juhel on 58!<BR>Grats Tearem on 53!<BR>Grats Valoura on 52!<BR>Grats Wellish on 50!<BR><BR>...will add the others soon!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Lokki on Oct 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 10, 2003 :: More Hedge Flagging.. alt night almost!</div><P>Wonderous led us in to get more folks flagged for PoNB, and lots of us dusted off those low level alts to go through. Nice work folks and nice work Tryder on being our only chanter through! And you only went LD once. /laughs</P>
<P>Grats Tryder on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Skull_lined_amice.jpeg">Skull Lined Amice</A>! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Oct 10, 2003 :: Rhags 1 & 2 didn't give up RGC!</div><P>Thanks to folks for running to Ssra to kill Rhag 1 and 2 today! Was planning to head back with more forces to give Arch Lich a try, but realized we didn't have that stupid key. </P>
<P>Grats Kithik on some <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/pictures/bonegolemvambraces.jpg">Bone Golem Vambraces</A>, Tryder on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/manatwinedstaff.jpg">Mana Twined Staff</A>, Drakshar on saving an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/earringofresistance.jpg">Earring of Resistance </A>from rotting, and Vaea on grabbing an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=13332">Orb of Luclinite</A> before it too rotted! Some spells dropped, but not the much desired Remove Greater Curse. </P>
<P>Rhag'Mozdezh only dropped one item for us. Grats Greylok on a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/fpics/crystal_of_interpretation.jpg">Crystal of Interpretation</A>, and Grajin on saving another Orb from rotting, and some more spells. </P>
<P>No pictures, just imagine big undead snakes. /nods</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=10'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=9'>9</a> <a href='news.asp?page=10'>10</a> 11 <a href='news.asp?page=12'>12</a> <a href='news.asp?page=13'>13</a> &nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=12'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
